  m_Text: "Press Alt Fire to throw a <color=orange>coin</color>.\n\nHit an <color=orange>airborne</color> coin to <color=orange>deflect</color> your shot into the nearest enemy's <color=orange>weakpoint</color>.\n\nEach coin <color=orange>increases</color> the shot's power."
